        body: "The 'before' breaks four laws at once. It sells to the intellect first (Law 3), expects money before time (Law 4), relies on sight alone (Law 5) and wants a high return with no time and no risk (Law 6). The 'after' doesn't need a bigger budget. It just puts things in a different order."
